# Chocobo on the Loose! (jeuno 92): finishes outside their state. A level 25 Warrior. 10093 open, the quest set
# accepted by a GM: no 10093 finish there: nothing. Prog 3 (a GM): 10100 open, the quest set available by a GM: nothing
# (Prog 3, no Timer, no mustZone).
# Brutus's other quests are kept silent: Chocobo's Wounds and Save My Son completed (a GM, before login: Chocobo's
# Wounds' completed section wants Save My Son not completed), level 25 (Path of the Beastmaster wants 30); his script
# then starts nothing (Chocobo's Wounds completed, Wings of Gold / Scattered into Shadow not); a talk with
# no quest reply plays his default 66 (DefaultActions).
lists UpperJeuno/Brutus/onTrigger UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/10093 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/10100
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-55.5,8.2,97.5 job=WAR lvl=25
quest Jeuno.ChocobosWounds completed
quest Jeuno.SaveMySon completed
login
trigger Brutus                          # 10093
quest Jeuno.ChocoboOnTheLoose accepted  # a GM, while 10093 is open
finish                                  # nothing
charvar Quest[3][92]Prog 3              # a GM
trigger Brutus                          # Prog 3: 10100
quest Jeuno.ChocoboOnTheLoose available # a GM, while 10100 is open
finish                                  # nothing
